{"id":"aguacate","es":"aguacate","en":["avocado"],"pos":"noun","topic":"food","note":"m. A slice comes with almost every Colombian lunch.","sent":{"es":"El almuerzo viene con {aguacate}.","en":"Lunch comes with avocado."}}
