{"id":"galleta","es":"galleta","en":["biscuit"],"pos":"noun","topic":"food","note":"f.","sent":{"es":"¿Quieres una {galleta}?","en":"Would you like a biscuit?"}}
{"id":"chocolate","es":"chocolate","en":["chocolate","hot chocolate"],"pos":"noun","topic":"food","note":"m. In Colombia, often the hot drink, with cheese dropped in.","sent":{"es":"Un {chocolate} caliente con queso.","en":"A hot chocolate with cheese."}}
{"id":"helado","es":"helado","en":["ice cream"],"pos":"noun","topic":"food","note":"m. As an adjective, freezing cold.","sent":{"es":"Vamos por un {helado}.","en":"Let us go and get an ice cream."}}
