{"id":"gaseosa","es":"gaseosa","en":["fizzy drink"],"pos":"noun","topic":"food","note":"f. The Colombian word for any soft drink with bubbles.","sent":{"es":"Una {gaseosa} bien fría, por favor.","en":"A really cold fizzy drink, please."}}
{"id":"aromatica","es":"aromática","en":["herbal tea"],"pos":"noun","topic":"food","note":"f. Colombian. Hot water on fruit or herbs, offered when you feel ill.","sent":{"es":"¿Quieres una {aromática}?","en":"Would you like a herbal tea?"}}
