{"id":"res","es":"res","en":["beef"],"pos":"noun","topic":"food","note":"f. carne de res is beef.","sent":{"es":"Prefiero carne de {res}.","en":"I prefer beef."}}
{"id":"mariscos","es":"mariscos","en":["seafood"],"pos":"noun","topic":"food","note":"m. pl. On the Caribbean coast they are everywhere.","sent":{"es":"En la costa se comen muchos {mariscos}.","en":"On the coast people eat a lot of seafood."}}
{"id":"camaron","es":"camarón","en":["prawn"],"pos":"noun","topic":"food","note":"m. Plural camarones.","sent":{"es":"Un arroz con {camarones}, por favor.","en":"Prawn rice, please."}}
